=== WHY THIS LICENSE FOR EXTENDED DATA ===

The Extended dataset (jccdb-v2-extended.csv) contains 54,479 line items
generated through matrix expansion of manufacturer × series × specification
× color combinations. While these combinations are derived from real
product lines, individual SKU existence has NOT been verified against
current manufacturer catalogs.

Commercial users must perform SKU-level verification against current
manufacturer catalogs before incorporating this data into commercial
products or services.

The Verified dataset (jccdb-v2-schema.csv) — containing 11,250 hand-
verified items — is released under CC BY 4.0 and permits commercial use.

